('W50_SIMPLE_CHART', 'WRITING', 'DEMO-PS-W50_SIMPLE_CHART-3', 'Luyện thêm: Table of tea consumption', 2, 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'A table shows tea consumption (kg per person per year): Turkey 3.0, UK 1.9, China 1.2. Which opening sentence is best?', 'I like tea.', 'Tea is good for health.', 'The table shows how much tea people drank in three countries.', 'C', NULL, 'A good opening paraphrases what the table shows.', NULL, 'EASY'),
('W50_SIMPLE_CHART', 'WRITING', 'DEMO-PS-W50_SIMPLE_CHART-3', 'Luyện thêm: Table of tea consumption', 3, 'FILL_IN_BLANK', 'Complete with ONE WORD: Turkey ______ the most tea. (past tense)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['drank', 'consumed'], 'Turkey drank/consumed the most tea per person.', NULL, 'EASY'),
('W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH', 'WRITING', 'DEMO-PS-W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH-2', 'Luyện thêm: Main idea and example', 1, 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which sentence is the best main idea for a paragraph about exercise?', 'Regular exercise is good for your health.', 'I went to the park.', 'Football is on TV on Saturday.', 'A', NULL, 'A main idea states the point the whole paragraph supports.', NULL, 'EASY'),
('W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH', 'WRITING', 'DEMO-PS-W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH-2', 'Luyện thêm: Main idea and example', 2, 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which sentence is a supporting example?', 'Health is important.', 'For example, walking for 30 minutes a day helps your heart.', 'In conclusion, exercise is good.', 'B', NULL, 'It gives a specific example that supports the idea.', NULL, 'EASY'),
('W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH', 'WRITING', 'DEMO-PS-W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH-2', 'Luyện thêm: Main idea and example', 3, 'FILL_IN_BLANK', 'Complete with ONE WORD: Use "For ______" to introduce an example.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['example'], 'For example introduces an example.', NULL, 'EASY'),
('W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH', 'WRITING', 'DEMO-PS-W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH-3', 'Luyện thêm: Staying on topic', 1, 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'A paragraph should have:', 'Five different topics', 'Only a list of words', 'One main idea with support', 'C', NULL, 'A paragraph has one main idea and details that support it.', NULL, 'EASY'),
('W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH', 'WRITING', 'DEMO-PS-W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH-3', 'Luyện thêm: Staying on topic', 2, 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which sentence stays on topic in a paragraph about public libraries?', 'Libraries give people free access to books.', 'My brother has a new car.', 'It rained all week.', 'A', NULL, 'Only the first sentence is about libraries.', NULL, 'EASY'),
('W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH', 'WRITING', 'DEMO-PS-W55_SIMPLE_PARAGRAPH-3', 'Luyện thêm: Staying on topic', 3, 'FILL_IN_BLANK', 'Complete with ONE WORD: The first sentence usually states the ______ idea.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['main'], 'The topic sentence states the main idea.', NULL, 'EASY');
